# Check every text file out with LF, on every platform.
#
# Without this, a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true gets a CRLF working tree
# while CI gets LF, so tooling that anchors on "\n" behaves differently in the
# two places. That is how the documented-example checks came to find nothing
# locally while passing in CI.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Generated bundle: committed, and compared byte for byte by `pnpm verify:dist`.
packages/github-action/dist/** -text
